<title>HONG KONG: Credit Lyonnais HK$ FRCD reply date changed.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais HK$ FRCD reply date changed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The reply deadline for Credit Lyonnais Hong Kong branch's HK$1.0 billion three-year floating rate certificates of deposit issue has been brought forward to 1700 Hong Kong time on April 15 from April 17, arranger HSBC Markets said on Monday.</p>
<p>All other terms are unchanged.</p>
<p>The issue was priced at par on April 2 to float at 32 basis points over the three-month Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate. With fees, the all-in return for top-tier managers is 40 basis points.</p>
<p>Joint bookrunners are Credit Lyonnais and HSBC Markets.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
